---
import MainLayout from '../layouts/MainLayout.astro';
---

<MainLayout
  title="Services - Aura & Scape"
  description="Explore our services: Events, Decor, Experiences, and Full Packages. Luxury event design by Antima & Shilpa, Edinburgh."
>
  <!-- Page Hero -->
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="container text-center">
      <h1>Our Services</h1>
      <div class="divider"></div>
      <p class="text-muted" style="max-width: 500px; margin: 16px auto 0;">Every service is crafted with the same care — attention to detail, a love of colour, and a genuine desire to see your face when you walk into the space we've created.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Services Grid -->
  <section class="section section--cream">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="services-full-grid reveal-stagger">
        <div class="service-card">
          <div class="service-icon">
            <svg width="56" height="56" viewBox="0 0 56 56" fill="none" stroke="#D4AF37" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
              <path d="M10 48V22C10 12 18 6 28 6s18 6 18 16v26"/>
              <path d="M17 48V24c0-6 3-10 11-10s11 4 11 10v24"/>
              <line x1="8" y1="48" x2="48" y2="48"/>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3>Events</h3>
          <p>Full event planning and coordination. From venue selection to final walk-through, we handle every detail so you can simply be present in your celebration.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="service-card">
          <div class="service-icon">
            <svg width="56" height="56" viewBox="0 0 56 56" fill="none" stroke="#D4AF37" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
              <rect x="10" y="8" width="36" height="40" rx="1"/>
              <path d="M10 8h36"/>
              <path d="M20 8v40"/>
              <path d="M36 8v40"/>
              <path d="M20 28c3-3 5-4 8-4s5 1 8 4"/>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3>Decor</h3>
          <p>Statement backdrops, floral installations, draping, lighting, and tablescapes. We design environments that feel like a story worth stepping into.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="service-card">
          <div class="service-icon">
            <svg width="56" height="56" viewBox="0 0 56 56" fill="none" stroke="#D4AF37" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
              <path d="M14 10v4"/><path d="M14 14c-3 0-5 2-5 6v4c0 4 2 6 5 6s5-2 5-6v-4c0-4-2-6-5-6z"/>
              <line x1="14" y1="30" x2="14" y2="46"/>
              <path d="M28 8v4"/><path d="M28 12c-3 0-5 2-5 6v4c0 4 2 6 5 6s5-2 5-6v-4c0-4-2-6-5-6z"/>
              <line x1="28" y1="28" x2="28" y2="46"/>
              <path d="M42 10v4"/><path d="M42 14c-3 0-5 2-5 6v4c0 4 2 6 5 6s5-2 5-6v-4c0-4-2-6-5-6z"/>
              <line x1="42" y1="30" x2="42" y2="46"/>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3>Experiences</h3>
          <p>Curated sensory moments — live music, fragrance stations, interactive displays, and surprise elements that make guests feel truly special.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="service-card">
          <div class="service-icon">
            <svg width="56" height="56" viewBox="0 0 56 56" fill="none" stroke="#D4AF37" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
              <path d="M28 42s-12-8-12-17c0-5 3.5-8.5 8.5-8.5 2 0 3 .7 3.5 2 .5-1.3 1.5-2 3.5-2 5 0 8.5 3.5 8.5 8.5 0 9-12 17-12 17z"/>
              <path d="M12 34c-2.5 3.5-3.5 8-2.5 12"/>
              <path d="M44 34c2.5 3.5 3.5 8 2.5 12"/>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3>Personalised Touch</h3>
          <p>Custom stationery, keepsakes, monogrammed details, and bespoke elements that make your event unmistakably yours.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="service-card">
          <div class="service-icon">
            <svg width="56" height="56" viewBox="0 0 56 56" fill="none" stroke="#D4AF37" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
              <path d="M28 6v8M28 42v8M6 28h8M42 28h8M13 13l5.5 5.5M37.5 37.5L43 43M13 43l5.5-5.5M37.5 18.5L43 13"/>
              <path d="M28 18l3 7 7 3-7 3-3 7-3-7-7-3 7-3z"/>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3>Magical Memories</h3>
          <p>Photo booths, guest books, video installations, and curated keepsakes that preserve your celebration for years to come.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="service-card">
          <div class="service-icon">
            <svg width="56" height="56" viewBox="0 0 56 56" fill="none" stroke="#D4AF37" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
              <circle cx="28" cy="28" r="18"/>
              <path d="M28 18v10l7 7"/>
              <path d="M22 46h12"/>
              <path d="M18 46c0-3 2-5 5-5h8c3 0 5 2 5 5"/>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3>Full Package</h3>
          <p>Complete event design and execution from concept to cleanup. One point of contact, zero stress, maximum magic.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- CTA -->
  <section class="section section--rose">
    <div class="container text-center">
      <h2>Let's Create Together</h2>
      <p class="text-muted" style="max-width: 480px; margin: 16px auto 32px;">Every great event starts with a conversation. Tell us what you're dreaming of.</p>
      <a href="/contact" class="btn-primary">Book a Consultation</a>
    </div>
  </section>
</MainLayout>

<style>
  .page-hero {
    padding: 120px 48px 60px;
    background: var(--bg-primary);
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .page-hero { padding: 100px 20px 40px; }
  }

  .services-full-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 32px;
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .services-full-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  }

  .service-icon {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
  }
</style>
